  <Strings>
    <Section>Story</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>9588</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ね、&lt;Shing&gt;。
&lt;Shing&gt;はシーブル村では
どんな風に暮らしてたの？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hey, &lt;Shing&gt;? What kind of stuff did you do in Seable?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>9712</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そ〜だなぁ……
毎日、ジィちゃんと
剣術の練習ばっかしてたよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Let's see... it was mostly sword practice with Gramps everyday.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>9836</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>友達と遊んだりはしなかったの？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You didn't hang out with any friends?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>9960</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>その……女の子の友達とか……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Were there any... girls...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>10276</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……友達はいなかったかなぁ。
シーブル村には同じくらいの
年の子がいなかったからね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...I didn't really have any friends. There weren't any other kids around my age in Seable.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>10568</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Shing&gt;には友達がいなかった
・さみしくなかった？
・そうなんだ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>So he didn't have any real friends...
・Were you lonely?
・I see...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>24</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>10708</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>さみしくなかった？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Were you lonely?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>10832</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ぜ〜んぜん！
オレも忙しかったからねぇ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Not at all! I had lots of things to keep me busy.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>11212</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>アクティブタにエサをあげたり
オリジナル木刀を削ったり
徹夜で星の数を数えたり</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I fed the Powerhogs, sharpened my old training sword, and stayed up all night counting stars.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>11336</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>どこまで海を泳げるか
挑戦したり……いろいろね！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Sometimes I'd challenge myself and see how fair into the ocean I could swim... a lotta things!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>11664</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……で、帰ってくる体力を
考えずに溺れかかったり？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...But, if you swam that far out, wouldn't you be too tired to swim back?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>11992</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>げっ!?
なんで知ってるの？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Huh?! How did you know that?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>12320</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あはは！　&lt;Shing&gt;の事なら
知らなくてもわかるんだよ♪</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Haha! I know you well enough to figure it out! ♪</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>13040</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そうなんだ……
友達……いなかったんだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I see... so there wasn't anyone else...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>13164</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ああ……だから、オレ嬉しいんだ。
&lt;Kohaku&gt;たちみたいな
友達がたくさんできてさ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah, but that's why I was so happy I got to meet all of you guys!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>14024</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>やだな、わたし……
&lt;Shing&gt;に友達がいない事を
喜んじゃった……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>No, that's terrible... I shouldn't feel glad he had no friends...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>14136</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>きっと&lt;Shing&gt;は
すごくさみしかった
はずなのに……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'm sure he must've been so lonely...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>14516</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……乙女心は複雑よね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...A woman's heart is a complicated thing, isn't it?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>14640</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Ines&gt;……!?</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Ines&gt;...?!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>15176</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Kohaku&gt;……
嫉妬や憎しみの想いは
誰のスピリアにもあるものよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Kohaku&gt;... everyone's Spiria has feelings of jealousy and hatred.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>15532</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>でも、あなたは、そんな
暗い想いを、ちゃんと認めて
向きあう事ができる</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But the important thing is to acknowledge, and face those unpleasant feelings head on.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>15656</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そういう素直な子……
私は嫌いじゃないわよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I don't think it's a bad to have such a straightforward heart...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>15984</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>きっと&lt;Shing&gt;も、ね♪</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'm sure he feels the same way too! ♪</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>16268</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……そうかな？
そうだといいな……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Really? I hope so...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
